{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"836d5478350b2284d41506063b52ebe1dc6ee487e797f3e6df73859f300ee4b3","ja":"って……もう！\nぬめぬめしすぎてて、切れないじゃない！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"71b9e9944161ba0aec4c3dd5434d2008094bf5e296186f8e015a096a5fae90d6","ja":"そんな力任せに握らんでも……って、ああっ！？\nタコが吹っ飛んだ！？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"63b7f5489573d846965b4c60d24435db497a535e136c7ccc944ac159575c3d31","ja":"きゃ～っ、頭の上に、タコが～！？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
