{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"d759c9f9adff49d59763aa73e08690c79ecf7c7268d95a264170887cba899d64","ja":"……ふぅ。ごめんなさい。手伝うつもりが、\nまさか、こんなことになるなんて。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"83b2ec2fc4ec83b043eac25ca02fdf6b65f2ad3f384b62b94b8ba4f9a394c7d0","ja":"私もびっくりしっちゃって……\n奈緒さんの邪魔ばかりしてしまいました……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"9666acf35fd58af94069deae404c43c27ba6d696e0ed48b299c19e652ffd1b8c","ja":"いやいや、ふたりとも真剣やったわけやし、\nそんな気にすることないって。それに……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"09f3ddf7b13a8653cc5a3cd5448ef5fb0d26ac66c7132311528ab5a165fb81ca","ja":"それに……？\n奈緒、どうしたの？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"f227e0dcef04baab4729cb2bae77622febac0e6ac6fb23e86343131c9cf4c99f","ja":"……ふっ。あははっ！　あははははっ！\n思い出したら笑いが。タコがあんな飛ぶやなんて！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"097f532cefa529a4dfcdee54a5f108e631e91e908622623e766316cce5d128d1","ja":"はぁ～……めっちゃ、笑わせてもらったわ～！\nふたりとも、最高やったで！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"2617b76eb35c273d7b31bb4ba7acaed4ac763dff3a51f84a49549afb9b5d5908","ja":"ええっ！？　な、何よその反応。\n最高って、どこがよ？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"913c20e96f488dd0f2a6f33357ff275b0707d5432ab2f1bbe4763e0498baac01","ja":"いや、だってこんな楽しい下ごしらえ\nなかなかないで！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
